# Let's go

When the user says "let's go", follow `docs/WORKFLOW.md`. One Ready task, then stop.

Do only what that task's Done when list requires. Use the smallest change. Do not invent a fact, a credential, a Firebase app, or an Apple team. If you need something from the user, ask and wait.

Commit the failing test before the implementation. Open a pull request. Do not review or merge your own pull request. The user starts a new chat and says "let's go" for the review.

After merge, upload to Firebase App Distribution and TestFlight only when `androidApp/` or `iosApp/` changed and every name in `docs/distribution/REQUIRED.md` already has a value. Do not add the Firebase SDK.
